{"id":259,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;根据《中北大学大学生综合素质测评办法（修订）》（校学【2021】10号）、《航空宇航学院本科生综合素质测评实施细则》，经学院动员、班级评议、班级公示、学院审核，现对本科生2025-2026学年综合素质测评专业排名进行公示，请查看附件名单。</p><p>公示时间为9月18日— 9月20日，凡对以上结果有异议者，请及时向学生科（航空宇航学院办公大楼301办公室）反映。</p><p>联 系 人：李老师</p><p>联系电话：0351-3922781</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" data_ue_src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\"><a href=\"/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1855776123&wbfileid=F700C71889D95155EDDE5B7C159C0DD9\">飞行器设计与工程综合素质测评专业排名.zip</a></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" data_ue_src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\"><a href=\"/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1855776123&wbfileid=00BCFFE39575F9BE0C7D5FD29B16C020\">飞行器制造工程综合素质测评专业排名.zip</a></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" data_ue_src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\"><a href=\"/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1855776123&wbfileid=79571EFD00721F2CC6B15357BEEA8865\">工程力学综合素质测评专业排名.zip</a></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" data_ue_src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource